{"id":"Prowl.PaperUI.RichText.RichTextParser","name":"RichTextParser","display":"RichTextParser","kind":"class","assembly":"Prowl.Paper","namespace":"Prowl.PaperUI.RichText","outer":null,"signature":"public sealed class RichTextParser","bases":[],"docs":{"summary":"Parses rich text markup into spans over the visible text. A tag is a name and optional arguments between angle brackets, such as wave 2 8 #f80, and an empty closing tag ends the most recent one. One forward pass, no regex and no backtracking. Tags are dispatched on length and first character, numbers are read straight out of the source span, and the only allocation per parse is the builder for the visible text plus any link hrefs. Buffers are reused between parses, so a document that is parsed again costs nothing in the steady state."},"attributes":[],"members":[{"kind":"property","name":"VisibleText","signature":"public string VisibleText { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":29,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"VisibleText"},{"kind":"property","name":"Effects","signature":"public IReadOnlyList<RichEffectSpan> Effects { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":30,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Effects"},{"kind":"property","name":"Styles","signature":"public IReadOnlyList<RichStyleSpan> Styles { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":31,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Styles"},{"kind":"property","name":"Colors","signature":"public IReadOnlyList<RichColorSpan> Colors { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":32,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Colors"},{"kind":"property","name":"Sizes","signature":"public IReadOnlyList<RichSizeSpan> Sizes { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":33,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Sizes"},{"kind":"property","name":"Links","signature":"public IReadOnlyList<RichLinkSpan> Links { get; }","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":34,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Links"},{"kind":"property","name":"HasAnimatedEffects","signature":"public bool HasAnimatedEffects { get; }","docs":{"summary":"True when any parsed effect animates, so a frame must evaluate glyph transforms again. Static markup skips that work entirely."},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":38,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"HasAnimatedEffects"},{"kind":"method","name":"Parse","signature":"public void Parse(string source)","docs":{},"static":false,"obsolete":false,"line":59,"path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","anchor":"Parse"}],"source":{"repo":"ProwlEngine/Anthology","path":"Paper/Paper/RichText/RichTextParser.cs","line":19}}